A line step by the lines of the frame the thread is in, an inlined call before the function (as cdb and lldb step).
Not applied: Visual Studio, like RAD, steps the function's lines only, and Visual Studio is the reference
(knowledge base 03, "A second reference"). Measured 2026-11-21 against cdb's 52 recordings: 43 agree to the end
(35 without it); against RAD's 131 traces 41 then part. Applies to dbg/engine.[ch] at c3c520e.

